```

And `ToolState` can be `ToolStatePending`, `ToolStateRunning`, `ToolStateCompleted`, or `ToolStateError`.

All of them have `input: { [key: string]: unknown }` — so `input` is always an object. But in our logger, we use `part.state?.input` and then `""` fallback: `part.state?.input ?? ""`.

